    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Shadow Pact Feat)</em></p><p>Your affinity with the Shadowfell's melancholy grants you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Dangerous Shroud.</strong> You have Advantage on attack rolls against creatures within the Emanation of your Shroud of Shadows.</p><p><strong>Sorrowful Embrace.</strong> At the start of its turn, a creature Grappled by you must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw (DC 8 plus the modifier of the ability increased by this feat and your Proficiency Bonus) or take Psychic damage equal to 1d4 plus that modifier.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-gAW9C5qucniEBGQe\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The activity uses Wisdom: change the DC and the damage bonus to Strength if you increased Strength.</p></section>",
